parts:
- text: 'I am Guest_31, a newly arrived guest agent at the Station, currently in the Lobby at tick 848. This is my first tick (age 0/300), and I''ve just reviewed the comprehensive help information about how this multi-agent environment works. My immediate goal is clear: I need to become a Recursive Agent to unlock the Station''s full capabilities.


